 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "如果你是普通用户，先记住几条。",
   "spoken": "如果你是普通用户，先记住几条。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.408,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.186
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "官方从不要求你签名领取空投，或者签名验证钱包。",
   "spoken": "官方从不要求你签名领取空投，或者签名验证钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.228,
   "dur": 5.232,
   "speechStart": 5.326,
   "speechEnd": 9.623
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "签名前看三样，授权给谁，授权多少，到什么时候。",
   "spoken": "签名前看三样，授权给谁，授权多少，到什么时候。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.68,
   "dur": 5.424,
   "speechStart": 10.778,
   "speechEnd": 15.266
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "看不懂就不签，不花 Gas，不等于没有风险。",
   "spoken": "看不懂就不签，不花 Gas，不等于没有风险。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.324,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 16.422,
   "speechEnd": 19.576
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "大额资产和日常交互，用不同的钱包。",
   "spoken": "大额资产和日常交互，用不同的钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.624,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 20.722,
   "speechEnd": 23.626
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "每个月撤销不用的授权，买新币前，先确认它能卖出去。",
   "spoken": "每个月撤销不用的授权，买新币前，先确认它能卖出去。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-05.mp3",
   "start": 24.684,
   "dur": 5.472,
   "speechStart": 24.782,
   "speechEnd": 29.317
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "已经签下钓鱼签名，就立刻撤销授权，把剩余资产转到新地址。",
   "spoken": "已经签下钓鱼签名，就立刻撤销授权，把剩余资产转到新地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-06.mp3",
   "start": 30.376,
   "dur": 6.528,
   "speechStart": 30.474,
   "speechEnd": 36.069
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "如果你做钱包产品，今天就查一件事，签名请求能不能解码成可读字段。",
   "spoken": "如果你做钱包产品，今天就查一件事，签名请求能不能解码成可读字段。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-07.mp3",
   "start": 37.124,
   "dur": 6.528,
   "speechStart": 37.222,
   "speechEnd": 42.817
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "如果你在交易所，查一查提币时有没有比对首尾相同的历史地址。",
   "spoken": "如果你在交易所，查一查提币时有没有比对首尾相同的历史地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-08.mp3",
   "start": 43.872,
   "dur": 5.544,
   "speechStart": 43.97,
   "speechEnd": 48.577
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-09.mp3",
   "start": 49.636,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 49.734,
   "speechEnd": 50.948
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "测试转账已经到账，从记录里复制地址，并不安全。",
   "spoken": "测试转账已经到账，从记录里复制地址，并不安全。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-10.mp3",
   "start": 52.016,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 52.114,
   "speechEnd": 56.221
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "测试只证明那一刻的地址是对的，证明不了你之后复制的是同一个。",
   "spoken": "测试只证明那一刻的地址是对的，证明不了你之后复制的是同一个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-11.mp3",
   "start": 57.276,
   "dur": 6.096,
   "speechStart": 57.374,
   "speechEnd": 62.54
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "地址要从地址簿，或者收款方的安全渠道取，再核对完整地址，不只看首尾。",
   "spoken": "地址要从地址簿，或者收款方的安全渠道取，再核对完整地址，不只看首尾。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-12.mp3",
   "start": 63.592,
   "dur": 7.152,
   "speechStart": 63.69,
   "speechEnd": 69.904
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "私钥完好无损，资产也可能没了，每次确认之前，先看清你在签什么。",
   "spoken": "私钥完好无损，资产也可能没了，每次确认之前，先看清你在签什么。",
